  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Fortalecimiento Institucional y Operativo del Sector Energa II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Institutional Strengthening of the Energy Sector II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Objetivo general del proyecto, es apoyar el crecimiento de Suriname a travs de la promocin de energa sostenible y asegurar la competividad del pas. Dentro de los objetivos especficos se mencionan: i) apoyo a la formulacin de polticas y legislacin que promuevan ER, EE EC y Acceso; ii) apoyar medidas que promuevan la reduccin de GHG y adaptacin al cambio climtico; y iii) motivar el fortalecimiento institucional y el desarrollo de capacidades para alcanzar la sostenibilidad del sector.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to support Surinam growth by promoting sustainable energy, and therefore contributing to the countrys competiveness. The specific Objectives are: (i) support the formulation of policy and legislation that will contribute to the promotion of RE, EE, EC, rational and efficient use of energy; (ii) encourage measures to promote mitigation of greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions as well as initiatives for adaptation to climate change in the energy sector; and (iii) encourage institutional strengthening and capacity building requirements to achieve sustainable energy.</narrative>
  </description>
